{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01109",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.09,
      "end_seconds": 2.7,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "Good afternoon, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 4.27,
      "end_seconds": 9.11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.84,
      "text": "You're alright, take a seat. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.68,
      "end_seconds": 15.21,
      "duration_seconds": 4.53,
      "text": "Um, so... crushing chest pain. That's why I came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 17.15,
      "end_seconds": 20.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "Can you tell me when it first started?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 21.99,
      "end_seconds": 24.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "Ever since... since yesterday, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.12,
      "end_seconds": 35.21,
      "duration_seconds": 9.09,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.22,
      "end_seconds": 42.74,
      "duration_seconds": 5.52,
      "text": "It's worse with exertion. I get some relief from rest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 43.65,
      "end_seconds": 47.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "Any pain going into your left arm as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 49.28,
      "end_seconds": 50.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.16,
      "text": "Yes, actually."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 69.24,
      "end_seconds": 71.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "Any cough, leg swelling or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 73.0,
      "end_seconds": 77.21,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "Right, no, I haven't had any of them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.68,
      "end_seconds": 80.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Any trouble with the waterworks?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.81,
      "end_seconds": 84.39,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "Nothing there, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.28,
      "end_seconds": 88.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "Any muscle or joint problems besides this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.04,
      "end_seconds": 90.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "Nothing else aches."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.55,
      "end_seconds": 103.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.64,
      "end_seconds": 104.73,
      "duration_seconds": 1.09,
      "text": "No, never."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.46,
      "end_seconds": 110.12,
      "duration_seconds": 4.66,
      "text": "Can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.87,
      "end_seconds": 116.06,
      "duration_seconds": 5.19,
      "text": "Simvastatin. I take it 20 milligrams, at night for my cholesterol."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.27,
      "end_seconds": 119.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Right, what about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.65,
      "end_seconds": 123.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "High cholesterol, for nearly five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 136.61,
      "end_seconds": 138.33,
      "duration_seconds": 1.72,
      "text": "Do you drink alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 139.92,
      "end_seconds": 141.46,
      "duration_seconds": 1.54,
      "text": "Nothing, I'm teetotal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.53,
      "end_seconds": 145.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "Tell me about your eating."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.46,
      "end_seconds": 153.24,
      "duration_seconds": 5.78,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.17,
      "end_seconds": 157.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "So, how active are you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.53,
      "end_seconds": 162.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "I hardly move around during the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.64,
      "end_seconds": 166.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "Are you on your own at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 168.13,
      "end_seconds": 170.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.61,
      "end_seconds": 176.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "Alright, time for your numbers, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.46,
      "end_seconds": 187.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "Nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.02,
      "end_seconds": 201.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "Okay: pulse 119, blood pressure 133 over 83."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 202.72,
      "end_seconds": 204.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.51,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.8,
      "end_seconds": 207.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "I'll come back to the numbers."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.03,
      "end_seconds": 213.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "Let me look at the area, I'll be gentle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.1,
      "end_seconds": 216.74,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "Let me feel here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.06,
      "end_seconds": 235.38,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "You are pale and sweaty, and your pulse is fast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 237.28,
      "end_seconds": 238.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.49,
      "text": "Yeah, no problem."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.94,
      "end_seconds": 245.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "That's all I needed to check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.75,
      "end_seconds": 261.72,
      "duration_seconds": 4.97,
      "text": "Okay, thinking it through, it fits best with a possible heart attack."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 265.3,
      "end_seconds": 267.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Is it dangerous, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.2,
      "end_seconds": 285.18,
      "duration_seconds": 16.98,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's a possible heart attack, and we'll know more once the an ECG is back. So, to recap quickly. You've had crushing chest pain, since yesterday, and no cough or leg swelling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 286.98,
      "end_seconds": 288.73,
      "duration_seconds": 1.75,
      "text": "Yes, that's right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.95,
      "end_seconds": 315.9,
      "duration_seconds": 25.95,
      "text": "I'll request an ECG, it'll help with chest pain. We'll begin with aspirin, 300 milligrams, once now, single dose. You take it by mouth. That's for possible heart attack. Stay lying down and do not eat or drink. I'm not ordering a troponin blood test today. If things carry on in a month, we'll consider it. I'll want another look straight away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 316.54,
      "end_seconds": 318.12,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "Yes, that's manageable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 318.63,
      "end_seconds": 325.61,
      "duration_seconds": 6.98,
      "text": "Tell me what you've taken from all that, so I can fill in any gaps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 327.14,
      "end_seconds": 336.41,
      "duration_seconds": 9.27,
      "text": "So, I take the aspirin, 300 milligrams, once now and come back straight away. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 337.18,
      "end_seconds": 343.31,
      "duration_seconds": 6.13,
      "text": "Right, yes, exactly right. I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 345.27,
      "end_seconds": 348.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "No, that's all. Thanks a lot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 349.34,
      "end_seconds": 350.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.18,
      "text": "Take care now."
    }
  ]
}